{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/how-it-works/layout,_N_T_/how-it-works/page,_N_T_/how-it-works"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/how-it-works/__PAGE__","/how-it-works","/_index","/_head"]},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--DJrayX8Ji5wiWYAO6ii2a--><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/4cd1a93ce66f1c02.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/0de584b7d143baff.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/82abf2d65f5428ae.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/f2f58a7e93290fbb.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/38eb66a58ed5ffd7.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-27c50f4289ff97bb.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/e98fe0e995e3d726.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/182495ea73cfac8b.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/d2be314c3ece3fbe.js\" async=\"\"></script><title>Who Owns What</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Who Owns What MVP on OpenNext + Convex\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico?favicon.0b3bf435.ico\" sizes=\"256x256\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/a6dad97d9634a72d.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><main style=\"padding:2rem;display:grid;gap:1rem;max-width:56rem\"><h1>Methodology</h1><div style=\"display:grid;gap:0.75rem;line-height:1.5\"><h4>Who Owns What Data Methodology </h4><p></p><p>In Who Owns What, we use <strong>property ownership mapping</strong> to find other buildings that your landlord or management company is associated with. Our algorithm relies on public <a href=\"http://www1.nyc.gov/site/hpd/about/open-data.page\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">HPD registration data</a> for residential buildings, which contains self-reported landlord contact information on about 170,000 properties across the city.</p><p>To group together landlord portfolios, our database:</p><ol><li><p>gathers the <strong>&quot;Head Officer&quot;, &quot;Individual Owner&quot;, &quot;Corporate Owner&quot;, and &quot;Joint Owner&quot; contact names </strong>registered on HPD.</p></li><li><p>gathers the <strong>business addresses </strong>registered with these contact names.</p></li><li><p>uses the <a href=\"https://networkx.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><u>networkx Python package</u></a> to group owner contact names together that share the same registered business address, which also generates an aggregated list of buildings for each grouping of owner names.</p></li></ol><p>According to HPD policy, “property owners of residential buildings are required by law to register annually with HPD if the property is a multiple dwelling (3+ residential units) or a private dwelling (1–2 residential units) where neither the owner nor the owner’s immediate family resides.” This data must be made publicly available according to <a href=\"https://opendata.cityofnewyork.us/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">NYC’s Open Data law</a>.<!-- --></p><p><strong>HPD updates this registration data (which updates live on this site) monthly.</strong> We also use datasets from the following sources to provide additional information:</p><ul><li><p><strong>HPD complaints </strong>from <a href=\"https://data.cityofnewyork.us/Housing-Development/Housing-Maintenance-Code-Complaints/uwyv-629c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">NYC Open Data</a> — <em>updated monthly</em></p></li><li><p><strong>DOB job application filings </strong>from <a href=\"https://data.cityofnewyork.us/Housing-Development/DOB-Job-Application-Filings/ic3t-wcy2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">NYC Open Data</a> — <em>updated daily</em></p></li><li><p><strong>Primary Land Use Tax Lot data (&quot;PLUTO&quot;)</strong> from <a href=\"https://www1.nyc.gov/site/planning/data-maps/open-data.page\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">NYC Dept. of City Planning</a> — <em>updated yearly</em></p></li><li><p><strong>Eviction Filings data</strong> from the <a href=\"https://ww2.nycourts.gov/Admin/oca.shtml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">New York State Office of Court Administration</a> via the <a href=\"https://www.housingdatanyc.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Housing Data Coalition</a> in collaboration with the <a href=\"https://www.righttocounselnyc.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Right to Counsel Coalition</a> —<em> updated daily</em></p></li><li><p><strong>Executed Evictions data</strong><strong> </strong>from <a href=\"https://anhd.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">ANHD</a> and the <a href=\"https://www.housingdatanyc.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Housing Data Coalition</a> via <a href=\"https://www1.nyc.gov/site/doi/offices/cpr2.page\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">NYC Marshals</a> —<em> updated daily</em></p></li><li><p><strong>Tax Exemption (J51/421a) data </strong>from <a href=\"https://data.cityofnewyork.us/City-Government/Property-Exemption-Detail/muvi-b6kx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">NYC Open Data</a> — <em>updated yearly</em></p></li><li><p><strong>ACRIS deed records </strong>from <a href=\"https://data.cityofnewyork.us/City-Government/ACRIS-Real-Property-Master/bnx9-e6tj\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">NYC Open Data</a>. Note: we only include deeds with an associated amount greater than $1. — <em>updated bimonthly</em></p></li><li><p><strong>Rent Stabilization unit estimates </strong>from <a href=\"https://github.com/talos/nyc-stabilization-unit-counts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">taxbills.nyc</a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/JustFixNYC/nyc-doffer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">NYC Doffer</a>, adapted from Dept. of Finance tax bills. This data is <strong>not</strong> conclusive, but should be seen as an approximation. See <a href=\"http://blog.johnkrauss.com/where-is-decontrol/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">this page</a> for more information.<!-- --><em>— updated yearly</em></p></li></ul><p>Our code is open source and accessible <a href=\"https://github.com/JustFixNYC/who-owns-what\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">via our GitHub</a>. For additional questions, or help with research, you can email us at <a href=\"mailto:support@justfix.org\" rel=\"noreferrer\">support@justfix.org</a>.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0de584b7d143baff.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[44636,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/e98fe0e995e3d726.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/182495ea73cfac8b.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/d2be314c3ece3fbe.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/d2be314c3ece3fbe.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\nc:I[68027,[],\\\"default\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/4cd1a93ce66f1c02.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"b\\\":\\\"DJrayX8Ji5wiWYAO6ii2a\\\",\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"how-it-works\\\"],\\\"q\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"how-it-works\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{}]}]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",true],[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/4cd1a93ce66f1c02.css\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"next\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefin